WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:18.383
"Oh no!" thought Flopsy.

2
00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:21.265
"The farmer is coming!"

3
00:00:21.266 --> 00:00:24.754
Mrs.Tittlemouse jumped into a pot.

4
00:00:24.755 --> 00:00:27.998
Flopsy hid under the paper bag.

5
00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:31.650
The other bunnies were still sleeping.

6
00:00:31.651 --> 00:00:34.522
Flopsy shook with fear.

7
00:00:34.523 --> 00:00:38.659
"This is terrible," she thought.

8
00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:47.397
"The farmer will get the bunnies!"

9
00:00:47.398 --> 00:00:50.356
The farmer had a sack of grass.

10
00:00:50.357 --> 00:00:56.468
He dumped the grass onto the trash pile.

11
00:00:56.469 --> 00:01:00.017
"Huh." The farmer looked down.

12
00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:04.396
"I see . . . little brown ears."

13
00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:07.914
The farmer bent closer to the pile.

14
00:01:07.915 --> 00:01:12.213
"One . . . two . . . three . . .

15
00:01:12.214 --> 00:01:20.570
Three little rabbits!"

16
00:01:20.571 --> 00:01:23.874
The farmer scooped up the bunnies.

17
00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:31.335
He dropped them into his sack.

18
00:01:31.336 --> 00:01:34.545
"Yum," said the farmer.

19
00:01:34.546 --> 00:01:39.318
"I have big plans for these rabbits!"

20
00:01:39.319 --> 00:01:52.039
The farmer tied the sack with string.

21
00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.963
"First I must put away my lawn mower.

22
00:01:55.964 --> 00:02:00.909
Then I'll come back."

23
00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:05.358
The farmer left.

24
00:02:05.359 --> 00:02:09.252
"Oh no!" Flopsy cried.

25
00:02:09.253 --> 00:02:13.766
She ran to the sack.

26
00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:18.158
Flopsy tried to rip the string from the sack.

27
00:02:18.159 --> 00:02:21.511
"It's too tight," she cried.

28
00:02:21.512 --> 00:02:24.422
"The farmer will take the bunnies.

29
00:02:24.423 --> 00:02:30.737
And they'll never come home again!"
